{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19990","headline":"寒溪 三 · 孟郊","name":"寒溪 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓饮一杯酒，踏雪过清溪。\n波澜冻爲刀，剸割凫与鷖。\n宿羽皆翦弃，血声沉沙泥。\n独立欲何语，默念心酸嘶。\n冻血莫作春，作春生不齐。\n冻血莫作花，作花发孀啼。\n幽幽棘针村，冻死难耕犂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19990.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19990","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}